WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.463
Run as published, the script
has two opposite problems.

2
00:00:03.463 --> 00:00:05.174
First, it's indiscriminate:

3
00:00:05.174 --> 00:00:09.999
it removes every delegated grant and
tries every application permission,

4
00:00:09.999 --> 00:00:12.567
with no list of what to
keep and no dry run,

5
00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.925
so a permission someone formally
approved goes along with the rest.

6
00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:19.233
Second, on Learn's own API contract,

7
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:24.508
its application permission removals miss
entirely: it passes the app's own ID

8
00:00:24.508 --> 00:00:29.700
where the reference says the resource
belongs, so all three answer not found.

9
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.440
The code keeps the requests as its model,

10
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:35.830
and adds the keep list,
the decisions and the plan.
